      hu: ["Jalil Mammadguluzadeh íróról nevezték el.", "A hagyományos azerbajdzsáni konyha központja.", "Számos történelmi halomsír található a környékén."],
      ro: ["Numit după scriitorul Jalil Mammadguluzadeh.", "Un centru al bucătăriei tradiționale azere.", "Are numeroase movile funerare istorice în împrejurimi."],
      en: ["Named after the writer Jalil Mammadguluzadeh.", "A center of traditional Azerbaijani cuisine.", "Has numerous historic burial mounds in the surroundings."]
